    "bufferMethod": "10-degree tiles; source clipped to tile plus 4deg lon/2deg lat; per-tile WGS84 azimuthal-equidistant local metric projection; 50 km planar buffer with 16 quad segments; inverse-projected and clipped to the 10-degree core.",
